eason":false,"v3_routeConfig":false,"v3_singleFetch":false,"v3_lazyRouteDiscovery":false,"unstable_optimizeDeps":false},"isSpaMode":false,"state":{"loaderData":{"root":{"i18n":{"locale":"en","language":"English","messages":{}},"config":{"websiteBaseUrl":"https://freepnglogo.com","gtagId":"G-TX1M3288X8","ads":{"enabled":true,"provider":"google-ads","id":"ca-pub-3249245417612565"}},"tracking":true,"session":{"userId":"Jn7sHOgLnTiWkTIWXcpfkQ"}},"routes/image.$slug":{"image":{"slug":"facebook-logo","title":"Facebook Logo","body":null,"src":"/images/all_img/facebook-logo.png","tags":[{"label":"brand"},{"label":"facebook"}],"formats":["png"],"size":25407,"width":2000,"height":2000},"format":"png","article":{"tag":"facebook","title":"Facebook Logo","html":"\u003cp\u003eSince its launch in 2004, Facebook\u0026rsquo;s iconic logo has become one of the most recognizable symbols in the digital world. From its early days as a collegiate networking platform to its current status as a global social media giant, the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eFacebook logo\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;has undergone subtle but meaningful transformations. Whether you\u0026rsquo;re a designer, marketer, or simply need branding materials, this guide explores the logo\u0026rsquo;s history, its modern iterations (including the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-2024\"\u003eFacebook logo 2024\u003c/a\u003e), and where to download versatile formats like\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-icon-png\"\u003eFacebook logo PNG\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-vector\"\u003evector\u003c/a\u003e, and a variant with clear \u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo\"\u003etransparent background\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Brief History of the Facebook Logo\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe original\u0026nbsp;old Facebook logo, designed in 2004, featured a playful blue-and-white wordmark with a cartoonish lowercase \u0026ldquo;f\u0026rdquo; on a square background. Over time, the design shifted toward minimalism. By 2019, the platform streamlined its identity, adopting a cleaner, geometric sans-serif typeface and a bold blue hue. The\u0026nbsp;new Facebook logo\u0026nbsp;introduced in 2024 retains this simplicity but refines the letter spacing and color saturation for better digital visibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/image/old-facebook-logo-png-image\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/all_img/1723789395old-facebook-logo-png.png\" alt=\"Old Facebook Logo PNG Image\" width=\"200\" height=\"65\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlongside the main logo, subsidiary services like\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-marketplace-logo\"\u003eFacebook Marketplace\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-messenger\"\u003eFacebook Messenger\u003c/a\u003e have their own distinct icons, often incorporating the classic \u0026ldquo;f\u0026rdquo; symbol. These variations maintain brand consistency while catering to specific features.\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/all_img/1730342312_facebook-logo-2024.png\" alt=\"Facebook Logo 2024\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Download Official Facebook Logos?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eUsing high-quality, authorized versions of the\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo PNG,\u0026nbsp;vector, or\u0026nbsp;SVG\u0026nbsp;ensures professionalism in your projects. Here\u0026rsquo;s what to consider when choosing a format:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTransparency: A\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo transparent background\u0026nbsp;(PNG or SVG) is ideal for overlaying on images, presentations, or marketing materials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScalability:\u0026nbsp;Vector images\u0026nbsp;(EPS or SVG) retain clarity at any size, perfect for print media or large signage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor variations: Opt for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eFacebook logo white\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eblack and white\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;versions for contrasting backgrounds. The\u0026nbsp;white Facebook logo\u0026nbsp;is particularly useful for dark-themed designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Use Facebook Logos Responsibly\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBefore downloading the\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo image, review Meta\u0026rsquo;s brand guidelines to ensure compliance. Key rules include:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvoid altering the logo\u0026rsquo;s colors (e.g., don\u0026rsquo;t turn the blue\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo circle\u0026nbsp;pink).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaintain clear space around the logo to prevent visual clutter.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse the\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo transparent background\u0026nbsp;version appropriately\u0026mdash;never place it over busy patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownload Facebook Logos in Multiple Formats\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBelow, you\u0026rsquo;ll find a curated collection of official and high-resolution Facebook logos, including:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-transparent\"\u003eFacebook logo PNG transparent\u003c/a\u003e (current design since 2024)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-vector\"\u003eFacebook logo vector image\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFacebook icon vector logo\u0026nbsp;(\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-white-png\"\u003ewhite\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-logo-black\"\u003eblack\u003c/a\u003e versions)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-marketplace-logo\"\u003eFacebook Marketplace logo\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;(with and without text)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNostalgic for the past? The\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/old-facebook-logo-png-image\"\u003eold Facebook logo\u003c/a\u003e \u0026nbsp;with its retro aesthetic is popular for throwback campaigns or case studies about the platform\u0026rsquo;s growth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/image/facebook-f-logo\"\u003eFacebook f logo\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;(the standalone \u0026ldquo;f\u0026rdquo; symbol) works well as a compact icon for mobile apps or browser tabs. Pair it with the\u0026nbsp;Facebook Messenger logo\u0026nbsp;for multi-platform branding.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you need a\u0026nbsp;Facebook black and white logo\u0026nbsp;for a monochrome report or a\u0026nbsp;Facebook logo with transparent background\u0026nbsp;for a video overlay, these downloads cater to all needs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDownload your preferred style from the high-resolution images below.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-02-25T22:48:50.708Z"},"relevantImages":[{"slug":"facebook-messenger","title":"Facebook Messenger","body":null,"src":"/images/all_img/facebook-messenger-0643.png","tags":[{"label":"brand"},{"label":"facebook"}],"formats":["svg","png"],"size":72677,"width":2000,"height":2000},{"slug":"facebook-logo-white-png","title":"Facebook Logo White PNG","body":null,"src":"/images/all_img/facebook-logo-white-png-0b16.png","tags":[{"label":"brand"},{"label":"facebook"},{"label":"social-media"}],"formats":["svg","png"],"size":54544,"width":2000,"height":2000},{"slug":"facebook-name-logo-png","title":"Facebook Name Logo PNG","body":"This image features the iconic Facebook name logo in a clean and simple blue font. The design emphasizes the brand's modern and digital essence, making it easily recognizable. Perfect for showcasing social media branding, this PNG format allows for versatile use in various online projects, marketing materials, and presentations related to social networking. The logo serves as a symbol of connection and communication in the digital age, ideal for anyone looking to enhance their presence in the social media landscape.","src":"/images/all_img/1697562719facebook-name-logo-png.png","tags":[{"label":"brand"},{"label":"facebook"}],"formats":["png"],"size":24929,"width":3000,"height":585}]}},"actionData":null,"errors":null}};</script><script type="module" async="">import "/assets/manifest-a2bb0760.js";
